#QUESTION 2- check if a list contains palindrome..

# to check palindrome in programming.. hum pehle ek list ki copy banaenge, then us copy wali list ko reverse krenge, agr reverse krne k baadwo original list ke hi barabar aagyi, toh palindrome hai...
#see:
list1=[1,2,3,2,1] #palindrome hai as we can see

copy_list1=list1.copy() #copy banai

copy_list1.reverse() #reverse kia 

if(copy_list1==list1):
    print("lis is palindrome")
else:
    print("not palindrome")


